WEBVTT

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:13.180
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:13.180
TAKARA FANSUBS

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.830
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.580
Overlooking the rows of houses and stores

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.280
from the highest vantage,

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.780
Such things as tears and sadness

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.680
will quickly vanish

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:36.880
The birds, wind, and sunshine...

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.880
...all are your friends

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:45.790
I'll carry this dream farther than far

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:50.390
...no matter the distance...

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:57.590
I long to fly freely

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.790
through the blue sky in my heart...

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:04.690
The far distant blue sky

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:12.190
It flows into tomorrow

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:34.380
On his journey, Romeo encountered Alfredo, a boy who was surrounded by mysteries.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:41.180
Alfredo, too, was heading to Milan to become a chimney-sweep.

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:46.580
But their arrival was greeted by a brutal overseer,

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:50.880
...and comrades sharing their fate of slavery.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:58.880
Episode 5:

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:58.880
A Night in the Tavern

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:13.980
Hey! So we meet again.

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:16.380
Your face...

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.580
Looks like you got a raw deal.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.680
It was that big thug.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:28.180
They tricked me.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:32.180
I came because they said they'd give me 20 francs.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:37.780
And instead you got a knuckle sandwich.

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:42.180
What a bastard, hitting me like a damned punching-bag.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.930
Well, it seems we're all in the same boat.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.480
I'm Alfredo.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.580
I'm Romeo. Nice to meet you.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.040
I'm Dante.

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:08.130
You guys didn't get any food either?

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:10.380
No, nothing.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.530
Are they planning on letting us starve to death or what?

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:18.080
What's going to happen to us?

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.180
The God of Death...

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:25.880
...probably will put us on a boat and send us down the lake to Milan.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.230
The lake?

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:28.930
It's a shortcut to Milan.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:44.480
Send the brats by ship to Luino, then a hop-step and we hit Milan.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:52.880
So when are you setting sail?

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:56.180
Tomorrow morning.
I've got a boat on loan.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.330
Only ONE boat? For all those kids?

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:02.580
Don't say I didn't warn you if you tip it over.

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:07.780
One's plenty - brats, rats, same thing.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:13.580
Each little rat brings you 100 francs, was it?

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:17.580
Luini got 'em for just 30 francs.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.680
If we make a good profit, we'll be set for big business.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:24.330
Why, you're a downright scoundrel.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.880
Can't you sleep?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.480
No. I'm too hungry.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.580
You'll regret it tomorrow if you don't sleep now.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:46.630
Right.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:55.980
Yeah, I've gotta sleep.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.380
Sorry!

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.180
What are you up to?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.580
I'm getting out of here!

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.130
Get out?

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:12.380
Yeah! I can't stand it a second longer down here.

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:14.780
I'm determined to find a way out.

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:24.180
Hey! Why not HELP instead of wasting your time whimpering?

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.480
But... it smells so good. The chicken.

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:30.530
Chicken?

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.380
I can smell it.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:34.480
Oh, just a smell...

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.080
A smell?

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.230
Where's it coming from?

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:40.680
I dunno!

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:43.530
You noticed it a while ago, didn't you?

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:46.480
Try your best -- I know you can do it.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.580
Really?

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:49.530
Sure!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.180
All right.

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:01.180
Over there.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.480
Here!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.280
That's more like it!

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:17.280
Let's move this one.

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:27.580
Step aside!

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:46.080
Where's the wine!
We're running out!

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:50.680
Wait, Dante!

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:51.680
Let go!

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:52.980
They can hear you, Dante!

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.280
Are you two okay?

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:01.680
Yeah, believe it or not...

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:02.680
Me too.

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:43.480
Is someone there?

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:55.980
Just my imagination?

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.130
Don't scare me like that.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:04.330
Sorry.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.680
Be careful, Piccolo.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:17.630
Dante!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.130
Oooh! We missed you!

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:27.480
Hurry up!

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:29.630
Can't you shut up even for ONE second?

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:31.680
Be nice, now!

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:48.780
There, one more rappen.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:49.630
C'mon!

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:53.440
Lizo, go and check on the kids.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:54.830
What?

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:55.980
They might try to escape.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:57.980
Not likely!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.880
They're probably huddling together down there, scared witless.

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:05.980
Go.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:11.230
What's wrong with you all?

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:14.280
We found a way out!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:17.880
Unless they starve us to death first,

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:21.380
It looks like they'll just work us like donkeys! Until we drop!

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:23.480
Don't you agree?

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:24.380
As for me...

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:26.380
I can't run away.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:27.780
Why?

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:31.780
I promised to be a chimney-sweep...

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:34.140
...so that I could get a doctor for my dad.

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:36.780
I intend to stick with it.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:42.530
You're coming, right?

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:44.380
Stop it!

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:47.130
I doubt you'll be able to escape.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.380
The God of Death is a madman!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:52.130
You might get yourself killed.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:07.080
Fine. I'll go alone.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:09.580
Hold it!

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:10.880
I'm going too.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:11.680
You!

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:14.380
Last year Jusette went to Milan.

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:16.080
He never came back.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:18.780
Why?

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:24.880
Nearly no food for a whole month...
they found him dead in the snow one morning.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:28.280
He was...?

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:29.280
My younger brother.

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:44.480
I'm going too.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.080
Me too.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.280
Anyone else?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:55.880
No one, eh?

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.080
Wait!

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:03.480
See ya later, you good boys.

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:09.380
This is bad.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:11.880
They're gonna be caught for sure.

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:22.180
Feh! You coulda gone yourself, talkin' big.

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:34.880
For sure...

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:35.980
We're gonna be caught!

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.080
Hey there, Mr. Star Reporter...

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.580
what are you writing with so much enthusiasm?

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.480
About that "Alfredo" boy, on the reward poster?

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:12.730
Ah, no...

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:16.380
It's about last year's chimney sweep accident in Milan.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:18.730
Chimney sweep accident?

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:22.680
He died from hunger and cold.

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:23.980
How terrible.

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:33.980
Damn! Pain in the ass...

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:41.080
What now? If we're caught, the others are in for big trouble.

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:44.080
Then there's no choice.
Romeo, you go too.

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:53.880
Escape! Along with us!

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:56.080
How about you...

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:57.880
Alfredo!

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:01.480
I'll stay behind.
And keep them busy!

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:11.180
I remember hearing of a bunch of kids being
gathered together at a bar called The Wildcat.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.680
We could write an article!

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:28.180
Please take care of this.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.980
Alfredo, watch out for yourself...

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:35.280
Romeo, take care of everybody.

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:50.380
If we get through that door... we'll be free!

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.180
What's wrong?

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.180
Nothing, just my imagination I guess.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.880
All the brats're gone!

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:36.980
You little prick, tryin' to get tough with me...!

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.980
Where did the others go?

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.680
Tell me!

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.580
...or you're REALLY gonna get yourself hurt!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:49.680
Escape!

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:51.080
Alfredo, get away!

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:02.980
That little bastard!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:25.780
If I find that brat he's had it.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.180
Dammit, where's he gone off to?

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:44.780
What the hell's this guy?

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.480
Pathetic. They're just a bunch of brats after all.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:12.080
You little bastard, locking me in! Open up!

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:15.680
Open this door, god-dammit!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:16.780
Romeo?

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.530
What?

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.880
Why didn't you run away?

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:22.980
I couldn't leave you behind.

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:25.180
We're friends, aren't we?

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:28.280
Escape...?

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:32.500
Right, let's go help out Dante and the rest.

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:56.980
What was that?

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:59.780
A rat caught in a trap.

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:11.730
All right, let's go.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:39.380
Oh no...

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.280
What's wrong?

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.580
Escape, if you can.

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:10.980
Luini!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.180
Someone's coming!

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:19.280
Are you really going in?

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.330
Of course.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:23.380
That Alfredo boy might be here for all we know.

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:27.280
That's the newspaperman's daughter.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:28.680
This is bad.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.180
If we're found out by the newspaper, the operation's finished!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.380
What now? We're sure to be caught!

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:43.980
I know!

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.680
Hurry, climb up, Dante!

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:50.880
That's the ticket!

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:04.680
Antonio, just a bit more.

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:08.780
Luini, the brats've all escaped!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.980
Keep the people outside busy.

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:17.680
I'll go first.

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:19.880
Then we'll be free!

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:27.880
You coming?

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.280
Maybe they're not home.

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:43.380
Well, now! With this near-hurricane outside,

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:45.280
I'm afraid that we've already closed up for today...

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:52.480
Is everyone here?

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.180
Which way should we go?

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:59.780
We could take the main road, but where does it go to?

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:00.980
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.780
Wait, Michaello's not here!

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:14.780
Michaello!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:17.680
That hurts!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.680
Get on!

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:21.780
Get onto that boat.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:22.980
A boat?

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:24.680
You've gotta be kidding!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:26.980
We can't go out on a boat like that in the middle of this storm.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:28.680
Hurry up!

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:31.180
Don't you care if he dies or not?

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:34.380
Help!

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:35.430
How could you...

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:01.180
Row, dammit, row!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.080
What're you doing!

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:05.180
Put some strength into it, you brats!

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:08.480
Shit!

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:15.980
This boat is gonna sink!

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:21.380
It's gonna sink!

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.180
Alfredo, can you swim?

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.480
During the storm, the boat sinks into the lake.

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:00.480
Alfredo and I swim for our lives to the shore.

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:03.480
At that moment a bolt of lightning breaks through the darkness...

00:22:04.680 --> 00:22:06.180
The God of Death is drowning!

00:22:07.080 --> 00:22:11.480
Next time:
The Ship Sinks: Friendship Within the Storm
See you then!

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:17.280
"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:30.180
Si Si Ciao, why do the good times

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:34.480
seem to end so soon?

00:22:34.680 --> 00:22:38.680
Si Si Ciao, we're all friends

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:42.880
Let's meet again on these Roman roofs

00:22:43.490 --> 00:22:47.790
Your laughing voice dances

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:51.690
Once again in the sky

00:22:52.090 --> 00:22:58.990
Your pocket bursting with memories

00:23:00.690 --> 00:23:04.590
Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:08.790
Let's meet again on these Roman roofs
